#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:47 docs/guide/database.md:97
#: docs/guide/remote-access.md:194
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/mobile-app.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                                       | Common cause                                                                                      |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Keyboard covers chat input                    | WebView not resizing; rely on `visualViewport` inset (visualViewport only)               |\n"
"| Chat input unresponsive                       | No selected conversation; or Habitat RPC disconnected                                             |\n"
"| Habitat load failed / Failed to fetch         | Habitat not `--host 0.0.0.0`, wrong token, firewall                                               |\n"
"| 测试连接「网络错误」、浏览器同地址正常        | 壳内 HTTPS 需信任 mkcert 根 CA（`network_security_config` 已信任用户 CA）；或暂用 `http://…:2658` |\n"
"| 测试连接成功，实际「连接已断开」              | 测试含原生 HTTP + WebSocket；仍断连则查 token / WS 代理                                           |\n"
"| `Read-only file system` on save               | Fixed: prefs write to app private config dir                                                      |\n"
"| ZeroTier / 虚拟网卡 IP                        | Phone ZeroTier online; Habitat `http.host: 0.0.0.0`; shell URL without trailing slash             |\n"
"| Install `NO_CERTIFICATES` / version downgrade | Pack signs APK; uninstall old canary build then reinstall                               |\n"
"| 安装失败「签名冲突」                          | Uninstall `org.freeanima.app` then reinstall                                                      |\n"
msgstr ""

